{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32120","headline":"晓仙谣 · 温庭筠","name":"晓仙谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉妃唤月归海宫，月色澹白涵春空。\n银河欲转星靥靥，碧浪叠山埋早红。\n宫花有露如新泪，小苑丛丛入寒翠。\n绮阁空传唱漏声，网轩未辨凌云字。\n遥遥珠帐连湘烟，鹤扇如霜金骨仙。\n碧箫曲尽彩霞动，下视九州皆悄然。\n秦王女骑红尾凤，半空回首晨鸡弄。\n雾盖狂尘亿兆家，世人犹作牵情梦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}